WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
View. Inspect one actual daily rainfall layer and its source date.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Practice. Use invented daily values to make the arithmetic easy to follow.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Accumulate. A trailing total combines seven consecutive days of rainfall.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Interpret. Align each total with its final day; a climate anomaly still needs a baseline.
